{"id":"fuse_e","lemma":"fusée","pos":"noun","rank":3527,"glosses":["rocket (vehicle)","fusil"],"ipa":"/fy.ze/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7a/Fr-fus%C3%A9e.ogg/Fr-fus%C3%A9e.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fusées"},"formAudio":{"fusées":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-fus%C3%A9es.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon fils adore les fusées.","en":"My son loves rockets.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"son"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Ils ont lancé une fusée.","en":"They launched a rocket.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to throw","l":"lancer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La fusée devrait avoir atteint la Lune maintenant.","en":"The rocket ought to have reached the moon by now.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to attain","l":"atteindre"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"the Moon"},{"g":"now, currently"}]},{"text":"La fusée explosa quelques secondes après son lancement.","en":"The rocket blew up a few seconds after launch.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to explode","l":"exploser"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"second","l":"seconde"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"throw, launch"}]},{"text":"La fusée est en orbite autour de la Lune.","en":"The rocket is in orbit around the moon.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"orbit"},{"g":"around, about"},null,null,{"g":"the Moon"}],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]}]}